  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "WSLua: Add option to limit listeners to the current display filter",
  "description": "This adds an optional fourth boolean argument to `Listener.new()`. When enabled, the listener is registered with `TL_LIMIT_TO_DISPLAY_FILTER`, causing it to follow the current display filter rather than only the filter specified at construction time.\n\nThis is useful for interactive GUI plugins that need to react to user changes of the display filter without recreating the listener.",
