      "title": "WSLua: Let listeners follow display filters",
      "message": "WSLua: Let listeners follow display filters\n\nAdd an optional fourth argument to Listener.new that exposes\nTL_LIMIT_TO_DISPLAY_FILTER to Lua listeners.\n\nWhen enabled, the listener follows Wireshark's current display filter.\nThe argument defaults to false, preserving existing Lua behavior.\n\nAdd constructor tests for the new optional argument.\n\nAssisted-by: ChatGPT\n",
